  "description": "Flightline 26\" Plus has a personality all to its own with its unique 26\" Plus tires by WTB and a massive 2.8\" footprint mounted to alloy double wall rims, alloy hubs, and stainless steel spokes. Its sized as a 26, but it rides and fits like a 27.5 as it sits higher than a conventional 26\" tire. FL 26\" Plus features a 6000 series alloy frame with IS disc mounts, internal cable routing, internal head tube all matched to a Suntour XCT suspension fork with 100mm of travel. Between the suspension fork and the fat tires, you might not even notice the bumps were there. 24 speed drive train make FL 26 Plus and ideal adventurer and bike packing companion. Explore!\nHaro FL 26\" Plus, 6000 series alloy frame w/ internal routing\nSuntour XCT HLO 27.5\" fork w/ 100mm travel, hydraulic lockout\nSuntour XCC 42/34/24 alloy crankset, 50mm chainline\nShimano Altus M310, 8-spd rear derailleur\nShimano HG-200 8-spd 12-32t cassette\nWeinmann U-32 alloy DW rims, 32mm wide\nPivit alloy cassette 32h hubs, Boost rear\nWTB Ranger 26x2.8\" tires\nPromax DSK-300 brakeset w/ 160mm rotors",
